Homepage: https://chukdoo.io
Description: Offline-first E2EE Todo App
 Chukdoo is a privacy-focused todo application with end-to-end encryption,
 natural language parsing (German/English), and offline-first architecture.
 .
 Features:
  - End-to-end encryption (AES-256-GCM)
  - Natural language date/priority parsing
  - Offline-first with background sync
  - Cross-device synchronization via Supabase
